messages "Drude**Subj: possible buggy parry?Cc: onarionDate: Sep  5HiAs you know I log and count a lot so I found out that weapon parrydoesn't seem to work often, ie. it actually works rarely.This can be seen from the following stats that I have:(today I killed almost 75 giants ...)Total hits: 2034 (or 2030) ... this shows the number of rounds that I'vebeen in fight (times two)So I've been about 1000 rounds in a fight and did dodge,parry like:Dodge: 622,   Parry: 6 (weapon),  394 (shield)  and 15 partiallywhich shows that I'm able to dodge at least once every round or shieldparry but the weapon parry (which isn't at outstanding yet like theothers) doesn't do anything even when I choose to use the broad sword(which is a very light weapon).I'm not sure this is a bug since I'm fighting those giants and theyare supposed to be very strong which makes parrying more difficultbut I'd expect more succesful parries.If you have any questions on this then I might be able to answer them.Cheers, Drude**"
